        "heading": "03 / Source and claim-limit ledger",
        "accent": "green",
        "text": [
          "These primary studies support selected mechanistic ideas. The generic enveloped lifecycle and alternate outcome are a teaching synthesis, not a reproduction of either study."
        ],
        "contract": {
          "title": "Evidence → permitted claim → boundary",
          "fields": [
